
	Day - 45
	--------
	
	Parameterization
	----------------
	1) @DataProvider
	2) using xml file we can pass parameters to the test method -- parallel testing
	
	
	parallel testing using xml file
	-------------------------------
	
	Step1) created test case 
	Step2) created xml file to run the test case
	Step3) passed browser name from xml file and received in setup() method
	Step4) execute test cases on chrome, edge, and firefox browsers (serial execution)
	Step5) execute test cases on chrome, edge, and firefox browsers (parallel execution)
	
	parallel="tests" in suite level runs tests parallel
	parallel="classes" put multiple classes in a test and can run parallel
	
	



